From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agent Browser Authors <dev@agentbrowser.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] agent_browser: register the modular layer in GN

Adds the agent_browser/ group to the toplevel BUILD.gn so the agent layer
builds as part of the Android browser target, keeping all agent code in one
rebase-friendly directory.
---
 BUILD.gn | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/BUILD.gn b/BUILD.gn
index 0000000..0000001 100644
--- a/BUILD.gn
+++ b/BUILD.gn
@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
+group("agent_browser") {
+  deps = [ "//agent_browser" ]
+}
+
